                            	  2333: ; PATCH P13: ModeE_SyncCharBoardCursorToIndex (Attempt 6a part 2).
                            	  2334: ; Source-of-truth sync for the char board cursor.  Normalizes
                            	  2335: ; CharBoardIndex ($041F) mod 44, snaps the hidden slot (idx 43)
                            	  2336: ; to idx 9, and regenerates (ObjX=$0071, ObjY=$0085) from the
                            	  2337: ; index using row = idx/11, col = idx%11, ObjX = $30+col*$10,
                            	  2338: ; ObjY = $87+row*$10.  Call this after any direction move.
                            	  2339:     even
